### Inspect DNS zones

Get-DnsServerZone


### Inspect DNS forwarders

Get-DnsServerForwarder


### Verify DC01 DNS configuration

Get-DnsClientServerAddress -AddressFamily IPv4


### Verify DC01 internal DNS record

Resolve-DnsName DC01.engineering.local


### Verify domain DNS record

Resolve-DnsName engineering.local


### Verify AD LDAP service-location record

Resolve-DnsName _ldap._tcp.dc._msdcs.engineering.local -Type SRV


### Verify external DNS resolution through DC01

Resolve-DnsName google.com -Server 192.168.100.20
